<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">I Found Peace In Your Violence</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;â€œWho are you people? Where am I?â€ She asks with narrowed eyes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Â &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œMy name is Bow, and these are my best friends, Adora and Catraâ€ he says, pointing to the other people. "And as for where you are- uh- I guess this is just where weâ€™re camping out for the nightâ€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Â &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œWhat happened?â€ Glimmer groans, pain hitting her a thousand times harder as she clutches at her side.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Â &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œYou were fighting a clone- and you were doing really well!â€ He tells her before his nervous smile fades to a frown â€œWell, um, until the cloneâ€¦ It uhâ€¦ The thing is the clone itâ€¦ it sort of um-â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Â &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œYou got stabbedâ€ one of the women, Catra she thinks, states in a much more blunt manner.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Â &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œCatra!â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Â &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œWhat? Iâ€™m just telling her what happenedâ€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Â &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Glimmer gets injured in a fight and saved by two of the friendliest, most persistent people ever. Oh, and Catra.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Aka the apocalypse fic nobody asked for.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
